        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "vision.md",
          "contents": "Make me a website with the following details:\n\nI want a website about: Otters\nMake sure to include:\n- Interesting facts about otters\n- Information about how they swim\n- Places around the world to find otters\n\nI want the tone of my website to be: casual and fun\n\nI'm making this website because: I love otters and I want everyone to know",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "example-prompts.md",
          "contents": "Choose one of the examples below to highlight, then select \"Add to AI Tutor\" to add it to the AI Tutor textbox.\n\nThen tell AI tutor to complete this task.\n\n- Add a new section to the webpage about what foods otters eat\n\nOR\n\n- Change the background color to an orange and red gradient\n\nOR\n\n- I downloaded an image called \"otter.jpg\" and uploaded it to my project. Add the image to the webpage with a credit \"From Michael Baird Photography\".",
          "folderId": "0",
